 share its original repos"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"itory so others can explore it. Share on X · Share on Reddit · Discuss on Discord · Copy link\n>\n> *T"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"ip: READMEs with a clear demo tend to get more attention. Adding `dsh-plugin` helps with discovery, "},{"id":"p8s8","text":"and starring the list makes it easier to find again.*"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## What is dsh?"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"This is an independent, community-maintained directory, not an official DeepSeek product. Start with"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" the searchable directory: choose a category, compare project descriptions, and open the original re"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"pository for installation and compatibility details. For structured access, see catalog.json and llm"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ry for installation and compatibility details. For structured access, see catalog.json and llms.txt."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness is DeepSeek AI's open-source agent harness. Its core philosophy is **everything is "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"a plugin**: the model adapter, tool registry, session log, permission model, and even the agent loop"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" itself are replaceable plugins — \"no privileged core to patch.\" The runtime is built on Cordis (a m"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"eta-framework of spatiotemporal composability)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Mode | Description |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| **Standard** | Full coding agent: file editing, shell, file & web search, skills, planning, goals,"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" subagents, workflows |\n| **Code** | All of Standard, plus tools exposed through the Code Mode SDK s"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"o the model can combine multi-step operations in one TypeScript program |\n| **Minimal** | Two-tool c"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"oding agent (persistent bash + str_replace_editor) for benchmarking models |\n| **Creator** | Runtime"},{"id":"p13s5","text":" inspection, in-memory plugin experiments, and composing new modes — for authoring custom agent pres"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"ection, in-memory plugin experiments, and composing new modes — for authoring custom agent presets |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Developer Preview**: the official release warns that compatibility-breaking changes are comin"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"g. APIs and plugin contracts may change."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## 📦 Plugins (The Core)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> Publishing your own plugin? Tag your repository with the `dsh-plugin` topic for discoverability."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 🛍️ Marketplaces & Discovery"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Project | Description | ⭐ |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| dsh-market/dsh-market | The plugin market inside DeepSeek Harness — browse, search, one-click inst"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"all | 3887 |\n| bradeGithub/DSH-Plugins-Marketplace | Browse, install & update all GitHub `dsh-plugin"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"` plugins in the DSH Web GUI | 165 |\n| Nagi-ovo/dsh-find-plugins | A DSH skill that finds, installs,"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" and verifies GitHub plugins | 172 |\n| AdamPlatin123/dsh-plugin-radar | Radar index repo that auto-s"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"cans dsh plugin candidates | 1492 |\n| LaplaceYoung/oh-my-dsh | 700+ plugins registered only through "},{"id":"p19s6","text":"extension seams — no agent-loop modification | 58 |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 👁️ Vision"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The hottest category — giving text-only models \"eyes.\""},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Project | Description | ⭐ |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| liustack/modlens | The first vision plugin for DSH: paste an image, get structured JSON evidence ("},{"id":"p23s2","text":"OCR, layout, semantics) | 3962 |\n| Anionex/dsh-vision-toolkit | Intent-aware image Q&A;, long-screen"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"shot OCR, UI restoration, grounding, pixel diff, Artifacts, Web UI | 880 |\n| Anionex/agent-vision-to"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"olkit | Vision toolkit & skills for text-only LLMs: multi-image, Q&A;, frontend UI restoration, GUI "},{"id":